[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2617127780","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102103#issuecomment-2617127780","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102103","id":2617127780,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6b_jNk","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-27T23:29:28Z","updated_at":"2025-01-27T23:29:28Z","body":"Related:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/75555","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2617127780/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3263450989","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102103#issuecomment-3263450989","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102103","id":3263450989,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ChE9t","user":{"login":"timothyparez","id":2060470,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNjA0NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2060470?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyparez","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyparez","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyparez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyparez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyparez/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyparez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyparez/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyparez/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyparez/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyparez/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyparez/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-07T04:16:09Z","updated_at":"2025-09-07T04:16:09Z","body":"I have a similar issue in 4.5RC1\n\nIt boils down to this:\n\nThe project has two classes:  \n  \n - ComponentBase  \n - SampleComponent  \n  \nThe `ComponentBase` class exports 3 properties:  \n  \n```\n@export var weight : float\n@export var description : String\n@export_range(500, 10000) var length_mm : int\n```\n  \nThe `SampleComponent` prints out the properties  \n  \n```\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\t#These work\n\tprint(\"Weight: \", weight);\n\tprint(\"Description \", description)\n\t\n\t#This will print 0 if we leave the default value of 500\n\tprint(\"Length \", length_mm)\n```\n\nThe main scene has an instance of the `SampleComponent` class.  \nIn the in the `main` scene inspector we set the values for `weight` and `description`  \nbut leave the `length_mm` property set to its default value of 500.  \nThe value `500` comes from the minimum specified by `@export_range(500, 10000)`.  \n\nWhen you run the application, `weight` and `description` will have the correct value  \nbut `length_mm` will be 0. (unless you set it to value other than 500)\n\nTested with `Godot 4.5 RC1`\n\n\nSample: https://github.com/timothyparez/godot-subclass-range-issue","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3263450989/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6040726465","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102103#issuecomment-6040726465","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102103","id":6040726465,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaA4rwQ","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-07T15:00:40Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T15:00:40Z","body":"The \"code still prints 0\" from the OP is due to using \"%d\" in the MRP, the value at runtime is the default value from code.\n\nI'm not comfortable with changing the behaviour of default values based on an `@export` annotation, the Editor team should come up with a proper way to display values in such cases. In the meantime we could emit a warning if the default (including implicit defaults) is outside of the range of `@export_range`.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6040726465/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]